@startuml TripPlanner
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
actor User as Citizen
participant "Web Client" as Web
participant "API Gateway\n(Kong)" as Gateway
participant "SmartFlow" as SmartFlow
participant "AirQuality SOAP" as AirQuality
participant "Mobility REST" as Mobility

Citizen -> Web : Demande trajet sain
Web -> Gateway : POST /api/smartflow/trip-plan
Gateway -> SmartFlow : Validation JWT + routage

SmartFlow -> AirQuality : SOAP GetAQI(zone)
AirQuality --> SmartFlow : AQIReport

alt AQI > seuil
  SmartFlow -> Mobility : GET /lines?mode=metro
else AQI <= seuil
  SmartFlow -> Mobility : GET /lines?mode=bike
end

Mobility --> SmartFlow : Liste lignes / horaires
SmartFlow --> Gateway : Recommandation + justification AQI
Gateway --> Web : Réponse JSON
Web --> Citizen : Affichage du plan
@enduml
